8. Containerized Flask Application

Execution Steps
1.Create Flask application
2.Write Dockerfile
3.Build Docker image
4.Push image to Amazon ECR
5.Create ECS cluster and service
6.Deploy and test application

Project Overview
Containerized a Flask application using Docker and deployed it on ECS.

AWS Services Used
Amazon ECR
Amazon ECS
Docker

Features
Containerization
Easy deployment
Scalable application hosting

Architecture
Docker → ECR → ECS
